'''Mighty Kat-A-Pult''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Frontline Assault IRON LEGION (Gacha Event)|Frontline Assault IRON LEGION]] gacha event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.4 Update|Version 8.4]] increases range and area of effect. [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 13.1 Update|Version 13.1]] increases attack power and [[Weaken|Weaken]] chance to 100%, and also grants [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] targeting, more inner range, and [[Immune to Toxic|Immunity to Toxic]] and [[Immune to Curse|Curse]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.8 Update|Version 8.8]]. They were added to [[The Battle Cats Unite!]] in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

