==Trivia==
*The attack animation is similar to the attack animation of [[wikia:metalslug:Big Shiee|Big Shiee]] from the Metal Slug franchise with the main cannon appearing out of the vehicle and firing an explosive projectile.
*The Evolved Form's name is a reference to "Tom Clancy's Rainbow-6 Siege."
*Mighty Kat-A-Pult, along with [[Mighty Drednot (Uber Rare Cat)|Mighty Drednot]], [[Mighty Bomburr (Uber Rare Cat)|Mighty Bomburr]], [[Mighty Rekon Korps (Uber Rare Cat)|Mighty Rekon Korps]], and [[Mighty Thermae D-Lux (Uber Rare Cat)|Mighty Thermae D-Lux]] were one of the first ubers to be added via an update to The Battle Cats Unite.
*CAT-10 Gigapult's description refers to it as a "Panzer Mark IV", referencing the real-world [[wikipedia:Panzer IV|Panzer IV]], a type of tank commonly used by Germany in World War II.

